// Mission 3: Hunt with KQL (KC7 Cyber, "A Rap Beef")
// My best queries, explained line by line in my own words.
//
// Cheat sheet (sticky notes: each row = one event, each column = a detail):
//   where   = throw away notes I don't want   -> fewer EVENTS (rows)
//   project = cover up lines on every note   -> fewer DETAILS (columns)
//   Inbound = traffic coming INTO the company from outside (front-door camera)
//   src_ip  = source IP, where the traffic came FROM

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Query #1: What web pages did the suspect's IP visit on April 10, 2024?
// "This query shows the web pages (URLs) that the suspect's IP visited
//  on OWL Records' site on April 10, 2024."
InboundNetworkEvents          // traffic coming into the company from outside
| where timestamp between (datetime("2024-04-10T00:00:00") .. datetime("2024-04-11T00:00:00"))
                              // my words: "filters the time and date, a specific timeframe" (one day)
| where src_ip has "18.66.52.227"
                              // my words: "searching for a guest IP address, someone from outside" (the suspect)
| project url                 // show only the URL column: which pages they visited
